                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \widetilde{P_Y X}\to Y\times Y
            that makes it a family of groupoids parametrized by
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
