                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \widetilde{P_Y X}
            along the unit of its groupoid structures, to get a family of formal groupoids
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mover
                    %mrow
                      %msub
                        %mi P
                        %mi Y
                      %mi X
                    %mo ^
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \widehat{P_Y X}
            parametrized by
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
                      %mi D
                      %mn 1
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} D^1
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mn 0
