            will be the formal loop space
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mover
                      %mi P
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ^
                    %mi Y
                  %mi X
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \hat{P}_Y X
            obtained by completing the path groupoid
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi P
                    %mi Y
                  %mi X
